# URL of the deployed chat backend (see worker/README.md). This is a public
# endpoint URL, not a secret — fill in after running `wrangler deploy` in
# worker/. Until then, the AI Q&A gracefully falls back to the local keyword
# matcher (see src/lib/chat-client.ts).
#
# Copy to `.env.production` locally, or set the same name as a GitHub Actions
# repository Variable for the Pages deploy workflow.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_WORKER_URL=
